 Steam Lin <STLin2@winbond.com>, linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org, 
 linux-clk@vger.kernel.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, 
 Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzk@kernel.org>, devicetree@vger.kernel.org, 
